    "Cut the two vertical standards and the top rail from 2x4, then screw the standards to the studs.",
    "Screw the rail across the rack tops with the heavy-gauge closet rod set in drilled sockets.",
    "Fit the lower shoe shelf on two cleats screwed to the standards at 16 in off the floor.",
    "Check both standards are plumb before loading the rail, then hang the rod."
